L, without doubt. R, always bad news. V, avoid level drain (well, not so
necessary since you've already cleaned the Valley).
; but only once on Water (to avoid having it filled with other nasty
things, wait until they are all generated on Water and wipped them).
Beware of genociding too many things, that just call for the RGN to have
no other monster to generate that air elementals and Archons...

Do a lot of nurse dancing. A scroll of geno can bring up 50 HP, iirc.
A character with 600+ HPs and a AoLS do no really need to look at its
HPs... Just hack and slash.

If you want to use lots of pets, geno trappers and worms. Trolls are
always an annoyance but also make good pets.

Keep scrolls at hand (blessed and a few uncursed) as weapon of mass
destruction in case of emergency.

Don't geno insect, they probably saved my life on Astral in my first
ascension (somehow once in the corridor to the left altar, the giant ant
behind me did much less damage than Death...)

The extinctionnist FAQ had a list of all you need to geno as much as
possible. IIRC, that was around 45-50 scrolls. You're halfway :-)

But always remember that genociding mid-level monster will make more
high-levels monsters generated. And high-level monsters are not
genocidable...

